# README Workbench screenshot: a web page tiled beside a Gemini capsule drawn
# in its per-site palette. Needs the network; run on a fresh TURNSTONE_ROOT.
# The window is sized in logical pixels, so a 2x display captures 2400x1440;
# the README copy is scaled to 1600 wide.
resize 1200 720
settle 30
key escape
open https://www.iana.org/
settle 40
act Open node in Workbench
settle 40
open gemini://geminiprotocol.net/
settle 40
act Open node in Workbench
settle 80
assert wb-cells == 2
capture 03_workbench
log README live screenshots complete
